Error [E0121]: `t` was given away earlier, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/task_double_join.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     print(t.join() ?? 0)
    |           ^
 Why: after a value moves to another name, the old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: give away a copy instead (`~t`) where it moved
